Recipie for adding a new model.

1) Inherit from Model or sub class.
2) Implement the following methods:
   a) __init__ -- first call the super class init method then do your own stuff.
      Setup self.submit_script & self.continue_script
   b) modify_model -- modify the reference model for specific model needs.
   c) submit_cmd -- should return the command that submits the model.